覆盖。提交载荷不含 revision 和 schema_version。不要把儿童原话放入命令行参数或历史。\n\n`session-snapshot.json` 是 Sigma 会话唯一权威来源；禁止独立创建、修改或读取旧的 `state.json`、`session.md`、`turns.jsonl` 作为会话状态。存在任何旧文件时接口停止，须人工核对和安全迁移后才能继续；不得自动删掉旧文件或当作新会话。路线、coach 事件和正式证据各有自己的存储及门禁，不包含在此快照事务中；跨系统操作中断后须重新核对，不能声称整个学习会话跨文件原子一致。直接绕过接口的文件操作不受程序强制约束，本协议尚需真实 Agent 端到端验收。\n\n`turns` 使用追加事件：展示前追加 `{\"type\":\"question\",\"question_id\":\"会话内唯一ID\",\"text\":\"问题原文\"}`；收到回答后在同一次提交中依次追加 `{\"type\":\"answer\",\"question_id\":\"同一ID\",\"text\":\"回答原文\"}` 和 `{\"type\":\"analysis\",\"question_id\":\"同一ID\",\"analysis\":{\"understanding\":\"具体观察\",\"reasoning\":\"理由或 unknown\",\"support\":\"提示依赖\",\"next_step\":\"教学判断\"}}`。analysis 是非空对象，保留实际的完整分析，可增加必要字段，未知写 unknown；不得仅用会被覆盖的 state 字段存储。不得修改已提交事件。追问使用新 ID。每次仅有一个未答问题；暂停、恢复时按事件顺序寻找没有对应 answer 的 question，并恢复其原文。重复 ID、孤立回答、多个未答问题或无法解释的旧记录须停止并人工核对。快照校验新增回答及分析的关联和顺序；旧记录不自动重写，其他语义仍由 Agent 检查。\n\n`state.planning_basis` 是可选 JSON 对象，只记录影响概念顺序、长期复习需求或教学目标的实质性变化；及时更新真实理解变化，不能为了避免重规划隐瞒。每轮分析、进度显示、短期提示、选例子、下一题教学动作和暂停放在其他状态或追加事件中，不能放入 planning_basis；仅仅选择平行例子不会使路线失效。路线摘要独立绑定正式证据、家长确认及 Wiki，普通问答和修订号不触发重规划。Wiki 和正式授权每次仍须实时检查。\n\n动态复习使用 `sigma_plan_store.py` 同一规划存储：从已保存的问答和 analysis 发现需要复习时，标准输入 `{\"concept\":\"C01\",\"question_id\":\"来源题ID\",\"reason\":\"具体依据\",\"interval_days\":1}` 调用 `schedule-dynamic --learner <化名>`。`status` 的 `dynamic_reviews` 显示任务及到期状态，不因调度强制重发布路线。到期后 Sigma 自主设计动态题，question 事件额外写入 `review_task_id`；像普通问答一样原子保存 answer 和 analysis。然后标准输入 `{\"task_id\":\"任务ID\",\"question_id\":\"复习题ID\",\"result\":\"correct|partial|incorrect\",\"next_interval_days\":2}` 调用 `complete-dynamic --learner <化名>`，一次原子操作完成任务并创建下一任务。默认可在正确后按 1、2、4、8、16、32 天延长，困难时缩短；由 Sigma 结合具体表现调整 1—32 天。重复提交、未到期或没有关联完整问答分析时停止并核对。任务和结果仅为动态学习记录，不是正式证据、掌握或晋级授权。会话保存与队列更新不是跨文件事务：若任一步失败，保留问答，读取两侧状态，确认任务是否完成后再继续，不声称两侧都已成功。\n# 隔离验证适配：Sigma + 儿童试点\n\n本文件优先于同副本 `.claude/skills/sigma-with-wiki/SKILL.md` 中冲突的段落；无冲突的 survey、问题循环、回顾和误区追踪沿用原版。上游原文件 Git blob `4deba6755b43a7e469b08cb2d51b9608e217bc8d`，许可证与引用文件随原件保存。本文件是验证适配，不是正式上线。\n\n1. 成人陪同，使用化名。Sigma 会话存到 `pilot-c01-c02/records/<化名>/sigma/`；不可使用上游全局路径或旧跨话题画像。状态须在每次提出问题前、回答后、暂停/结束时持久化，保留原话、问题、提示、分析、假设、动作、原因、家长观察和路线版本；未答问题恢复原题。此验证适配不用于真实儿童。\n2. 根 Wiki 没有 overview 和上游类型标记：读取 `wiki/index.md`、全部 14 页、`curriculum/12-week-plan.md`，由 `python3 scripts/generate_roadmap.py --check` 检查结构。14 页是课程范围，不等于授权进入。保留每概念 Wiki Pages；上游缺 overview 的 plain `/sigma` 回退禁止使用。每次进入或恢复概念重读根 Wiki 和试点概念、相关资料；冲突或缺失即停止。\n3. 用 Sigma 的路线推理生成候选，输出到 `personal-roadmap.json` 的现有 schema 并调用 `scripts/validate_personal_roadmap.py` 校验；规划只是建议。停止调用独立 Planner Skill，保留其校验器。不能凭诊断标 mastered、跳过先修、凭 80% 或自评宣布掌握。以 `learning_evidence.py recommend`、证据聚合、家长确认和 coach 即时门禁为权威。当前只有一张 C01 已发布训练卡，不能满足不同题卡掌握证据；C02 正常情况下不可进入。\n4. 使用 Sigma 的问题、回答分析、追问、提示、例子、跨情境与复习过程，AI 自审适龄、只问一个问题、符合 Wiki、不泄露正式题答案。动态练习不是正式测评或授权。正式测评题、原题提示及支持仅走 `coach.py`，完成后通过 `learning_evidence.py capture` 采集；不能把动态练习写成已审核卡。对连续不理解提供不同方式、平行示范或休息；疲劳、拒绝或挫败立即停止并保存。只在具体证据支持时记录待验证假设；未知即 unknown，禁止学习风格、心理和稳定能力标签，不强迫填误区表。\n5. 不自动打开浏览器；HTML 和可视化只在需要时生成，不用上游固定每轮重写 HTML。继续学习须重新 survey、重验发布和先修，并先恢复未答问题；复习只在已允许的概念上进行。对未发布内容，未来路线可列但不得将其作为正式教学或测评题。\n\n## 阻断项修复实验（覆盖上文中旧原型说明）\n\n会话读写必须遵循上一级 [适配文件的强制会话存储协议](../ADAPTER.md)：每次通过 `scripts/sigma_session_store.py` 读取并以修订号提交完整快照，禁止独立使用旧会话文件；检测到旧文件即停止，先人工核对迁移。快照不与路线、coach 或正式证据构成跨文件事务，真实 Agent 端到端行为尚未验收。\n\ncoach 的正式 C02 启动及后续使用时在化名锁内校验已发布证据与家长确认；诊断与正式训练独立。以 coach 为唯一正式题卡执行入口，禁止直接将动态题当正式题。发布维护操作必须取得 `pilot-c01-c02/.publication.lock` 独占锁，coach、证据及规划在读期间获取共享锁，随后取得化名锁；未遵守该约定的外部写入不受保护。\n\nSigma 规划沿用个人规划 JSON schema；运行 `python3 scripts/sigma_plan_store.py publish --learner <化名> --plan <候选文件>` 保存版本和输入，`status` 检查 stale。正式证据复习仍使用 `complete-review --session`；动态复习使用上一级适配文件中的 `schedule-dynamic` 和 `complete-dynamic`，两者分开，不授予掌握或晋级。普通教学动作不触发路线重规划。\n\nC01 独立正确且理由充分，可以继续由 AI 开放探究、换情境或探讨验证方法，不能因为 coach 自动结束该张卡便机械跳到下一道诊断题。只问一个短问题；展示前检查适龄、Wiki 依据、事实、是否泄漏正式卡答案。仍要先保留原答、教学动作及追问，再展示。疲劳及时暂停；恢复先检查门禁和未答问题。未通过 C02 先修时不开始 C02 正式训练。\n\nWiki 摘要变化或路线 stale 时的顺序：先停止新增教学和发布路线，读取变化前可用快照与当前全部受影响 Wiki 页，记录变化与影响；若旧快照不存在或冲突无法判断，停止受影响部分并请求人工核对。只有完成核对后，才可由 AI 重新分析路线、记录依据、运行校验并发布新版本；禁止只复制新摘要或先发布再阅读。此条是在本次真实会话暴露顺序错误后补充的，尚未通过真实 Agent 重测。\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Atomic Sigma session snapshot; not a teaching gate.\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nimport fcntl\nimport json\nimport os\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport sys\nimport tempfile\n\nimport learning_evidence as evidence\n\nclass Invalid(ValueError):\n    pass\n\nLEGACY = ('state.json', 'session.md', 'turns.jsonl')\n\ndef read_folder(folder):\n    \"\"\"Read with the learner lock already held, or from an atomically replaced file.\"\"\"\n    dest = folder / 'sigma'\n    if any((dest / name).exists() for name in LEGACY):\n        raise Invalid('发现旧版 Sigma 会话文件；停止并人工核对迁移，不能自动覆盖或忽略')\n    return read(dest / 'session-snapshot.json')\n\ndef read(path):\n    if not path.exists():\n        return {'schema_version': 1, 'revision': 0, 'state': {}, 'session': '', 'turns': []}\n    obj = json.loads(path.read_text(encoding='utf-8'))\n    validate(obj)\n    return obj\n\ndef validate(obj):\n    if (not isinstance(obj, dict) or set(obj) != {'schema_version', 'revision', 'state', 'session', 'turns'}\n        or type(obj['schema_version']) is not int or obj['schema_version'] != 1\n        or type(obj['revision']) is not int or obj['revision'] < 0\n        or not isinstance(obj['state'], dict) or not isinstance(obj['session'], str)\n        or not isinstance(obj['turns'], list) or any(not isinstance(t, dict) for t in obj['turns'])):\n        raise Invalid('会话快照格式无效')\n    if 'planning_basis' in obj['state'] and not isinstance(obj['state']['planning_basis'], dict):\n        raise Invalid('planning_basis 必须是对象')\n\ndef validate_new_events(previous, current):\n    \"\"\"Validate new analysis records without rewriting legacy snapshot history.\"\"\"\n    turns = current['turns']\n    added = turns[len(previous['turns']):]\n    for event in added:\n        if event.get('type') not in ('answer', 'analysis'):\n            continue\n        qid = event.get('question_id')\n        if not isinstance(qid, str) or not qid:\n            raise Invalid('回答和分析须关联问题 ID')\n        questions = [e for e in turns if e.get('type') == 'question' and e.get('question_id') == qid]\n        answers = [e for e in turns if e.get('type') == 'answer' and e.get('question_id') == qid]\n        analyses = [e for e in turns if e.get('type') == 'analysis' and e.get('question_id') == qid]\n        if len(questions) != 1 or len(answers) != 1 or len(analyses) != 1:\n            raise Invalid('每个新回答须关联唯一问题和唯一分析，并在同次提交中保存')\n        analysis = analyses[0].get('analysis')\n        if not isinstance(analysis, dict) or not analysis:\n            raise Invalid('分析须为非空对象')\n        if turns.index(questions[0]) >= turns.index(answers[0]) or turns.index(answers[0]) >= turns.index(analyses[0]):\n            raise Invalid('事件顺序须为问题、回答、分析')\n\ndef operate(learner, proposed=None, expected=None):\n    folder = evidence.get_folder(learner)\n    dest = folder / 'sigma'\n    dest.mkdir(mode=0o700, exist_ok=True)\n    path = dest / 'session-snapshot.json'\n    with (folder / '.lock').open('a') as lock:\n        fcntl.flock(lock, fcntl.LOCK_EX)\n        previous = read_folder(folder)\n        if proposed is None:\n            return previous\n        if type(expected) is not int or expected != previous['revision']:\n            raise Invalid('会话已被更新，请重新读取后重试')\n        if not isinstance(proposed, dict) or set(proposed) != {'state', 'session', 'turns'}:\n            raise Invalid('提交须同时包含 state、session、turns')\n        current = {'schema_version': 1, 'revision': expected + 1, **proposed}\n        validate(current)\n        # Previously committed turns must remain byte-for-byte equivalent in JSON data.\n        if current['turns'][:len(previous['turns'])] != previous['turns']:\n            raise Invalid('不能覆盖已提交的逐轮记录')\n        validate_new_events(previous, current)\n        fd, temp = tempfile.mkstemp(dir=dest, prefix='.session-')\n        try:\n            os.fchmod(fd, 0o600)\n            with os.fdopen(fd, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n                json.dump(current, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n                f.write('\\n'); f.flush(); os.fsync(f.fileno())\n            os.replace(temp, path)\n            directory = os.open(dest, os.O_RDONLY)\n            try: os.fsync(directory)\n            finally: os.close(directory)\n        finally:\n            if os.path.exists(temp): os.unlink(temp)\n        return current\n\ndef main():\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=__doc__)\n    parser.add_argument('action', choices=('read', 'commit'))\n    parser.add_argument('--learner', required=True)\n    parser.add_argument('--expected-revision', type=int)\n    args = parser.parse_args()\n    try:\n        result = operate(args.learner, json.load(sys.stdin), args.expected_revision) if args.action == 'commit' else operate(args.learner)\n        print(json.dumps(result, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\n    except (Invalid, evidence.EvidenceError, evidence.coach.Stop, OSError, ValueError, TypeError) as exc:\n        print('停止：' + str(exc), file=sys.stderr)\n        return 1\n    return 0\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    sys.exit(main())\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Experimental validated Sigma plan snapshots and evidence-derived review queue.\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nimport datetime as dt\nimport fcntl\nimport hashlib\nimport json\nimport os\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport sys\nimport tempfile\nimport uuid\nimport learning_evidence as evidence\nimport validate_personal_roadmap as planner\nimport sigma_session_store as sessions\n\nclass Invalid(ValueError): pass\n\ndef sha(obj):\n    return hashlib.sha256(json.dumps(obj,ensure_ascii=False,sort_keys=True,separators=(',',':')).encode()).hexdigest()\n\ndef read(path):\n    return json.loads(path.read_text(encoding='utf-8')) if path.exists() else {'schema_version': 1, 'history': []}\n\ndef write(path, data):\n    fd, name = tempfile.mkstemp(dir=path.parent, prefix='.plan-')\n    try:\n        os.fchmod(fd, 0o600)\n        with os.fdopen(fd,'w',encoding='utf-8') as f:\n            json.dump(data,f,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2);f.write('\\n');f.flush();os.fsync(f.fileno())\n        os.replace(name,path)\n        fd = os.open(path.parent,os.O_RDONLY)\n        try: os.fsync(fd)\n        finally: os.close(fd)\n    finally:\n        if os.path.exists(name): os.unlink(name)\n\ndef parse_date(value):\n    date=dt.datetime.fromisoformat(value)\n    if date.tzinfo is None: raise Invalid('证据时间必须带时区')\n    return date.astimezone(dt.timezone.utc)\n\ndef task_id(item):\n    return sha([item['concept'], item['evidence_session'], item['evidence_at']])\n\ndef event_task_id(event, history):\n    if 'task_id' in event:\n        return event['task_id']\n    # Existing experimental records bind completions to a plan and concept.\n    for item in history:\n        if item['version'] == event.get('plan_version'):\n            matches = [q for q in item['review_queue'] if q['concept'] == event.get('concept')]\n            if len(matches) == 1:\n                return task_id(matches[0])\n    raise Invalid('历史复习事件无法定位任务，停止处理')\n\ndef queue(records, history, events):\n    latest={}\n    for r in records:\n        when=parse_date(r['captured_at'])\n        if r['concept'] not in latest or when > latest[r['concept']][0]: latest[r['concept']]=(when,r)\n    result = [dict(q) for q in history[-1]['review_queue']] if history else []\n    for item in result:\n        item['task_id'] = task_id(item)\n    completed_sessions = {event['session_id'] for event in events}\n    for cid,(when,r) in sorted(latest.items()):\n        old = [q for q in result if q['concept'] == cid]\n        if r['session_id'] in completed_sessions or any(q['evidence_session'] == r['session_id'] for q in old):\n            continue\n        item = {'concept':cid,'evidence_session':r['session_id'], 'evidence_at':when.isoformat(),\n                'due_at':(when+dt.timedelta(days=1)).isoformat(), 'status':'pending',\n                'reason':'已有正式训练观察；一天后复习为实验安排，不表示掌握'}\n        item['task_id'] = task_id(item)\n        result.append(item)\n    return result\n\ndef dynamic_answer(snapshot, question_id, task=None):\n    turns = snapshot['turns']\n    found = {kind: [e for e in turns if e.get('type') == kind and e.get('question_id') == question_id]\n             for kind in ('question', 'answer', 'analysis')}\n    if any(len(found[k]) != 1 for k in found):\n        raise Invalid('动态复习须引用已保存的唯一问题、原答和分析')\n    if task is not None and found['question'][0].get('review_task_id') != task:\n        raise Invalid('复习问题未关联该任务')\n    if not isinstance(found['analysis'][0].get('analysis'), dict) or not found['analysis'][0]['analysis']:\n        raise Invalid('动态复习分析缺失')\n    return found\n\ndef operate(action, learner, candidate=None, session=None, payload=None):\n    folder=evidence.get_folder(learner); dest=folder/'sigma';dest.mkdir(mode=0o700,exist_ok=True)\n    path=dest/'plan-history.json'\n    # Lock order is publication, learner, plan, shared with coach/evidence.\n    with (evidence.coach.ROOT/'.publication.lock').open('a') as pub, (folder/'.lock').open('a') as learner_lock, (dest/'.plan-lock').open('a') as lock:\n        fcntl.flock(pub,fcntl.LOCK_SH); fcntl.flock(learner_lock,fcntl.LOCK_EX); fcntl.flock(lock,fcntl.LOCK_EX)\n        store=read(path)\n        if store.get('schema_version') != 1 or not isinstance(store.get('history'),list): raise Invalid('规划历史损坏')\n        ctx=planner.context(learner, already_locked=True)\n        if action == 'publish':\n            plan=json.loads(Path(candidate).read_text(encoding='utf-8'))\n            planner.validate(plan,ctx,learner)\n            records=[r for r in evidence.load_evidence(folder) if evidence.current_card(r['concept'], r['card'])]\n            # Recheck Wiki and snapshots while holding the shared authorization locks.\n            if planner.context(learner, already_locked=True) != ctx: raise Invalid('规划输入发生变化，请重试')\n            item={'version':len(store['history'])+1,'plan_sha256':sha(plan),'created_at':dt.datetime.now(dt.timezone.utc).isoformat(),\n                  'inputs':{k:ctx[k] for k in ('curriculum_digest','learner_digest','evidence_digest')},'plan':plan,'review_queue':queue(records,store['history'],store.get('review_events',[]))}\n            store['history'].append(item);write(path,store)\n        if not store['history']:\n            if action in ('schedule-dynamic', 'complete-dynamic'): raise Invalid('请先建立路线，再安排动态复习')\n            return {'status':'missing','review_queue':[], 'dynamic_reviews':[]}\n        item=store['history'][-1]\n        if item['plan_sha256'] != sha(item['plan']): raise Invalid('规划内容摘要不匹配')\n        if action in ('schedule-dynamic', 'complete-dynamic'):\n            if not isinstance(payload, dict): raise Invalid('动态复习需要 JSON 对象')\n            tasks = store.setdefault('dynamic_reviews', [])\n            snapshot = sessions.read_folder(folder)\n            now = dt.datetime.now(dt.timezone.utc)\n            if action == 'schedule-dynamic':\n                if set(payload) != {'concept', 'question_id', 'reason', 'interval_days'}:\n                    raise Invalid('安排复习字段无效')\n                concept, qid, reason, days = (payload[k] for k in ('concept','question_id','reason','interval_days'))\n                if not isinstance(concept, str) or concept not in {c['id'] for c in ctx['curriculum']['concepts']}:\n                    raise Invalid('未知概念')\n                if not isinstance(qid, str) or not qid or not isinstance(reason, str) or not reason.strip():\n                    raise Invalid('须提供问题 ID 和复习依据')\n                if type(days) is not int or not 1 <= days <= 32: raise Invalid('复习间隔须为 1 至 32 天')\n                dynamic_answer(snapshot, qid)\n                if any(t['concept'] == concept and t['status'] == 'pending' for t in tasks):\n                    raise Invalid('该概念已有待完成的动态复习')\n                tasks.append({'task_id':str(uuid.uuid4()), 'concept':concept, 'source_question_id':qid,\n                              'reason':reason, 'interval_days':days, 'scheduled_at':now.isoformat(),\n                              'due_at':(now + dt.timedelta(days=days)).isoformat(), 'status':'pending'})\n            else:\n                if set(payload) != {'task_id', 'question_id', 'result', 'next_interval_days'}:\n                    raise Invalid('完成复习字段无效')\n                task_id_value, qid, result, days = (payload[k] for k in ('task_id','question_id','result','next_interval_days'))\n                matches = [t for t in tasks if t['task_id'] == task_id_value]\n                if len(matches) != 1 or matches[0]['status'] != 'pending': raise Invalid('复习任务不存在或已完成')\n                task = matches[0]\n                if parse_date(task['due_at']) > now: raise Invalid('复习任务尚未到期')\n                if not isinstance(qid, str) or not qid: raise Invalid('复习问题 ID 无效')\n                if result not in ('correct', 'partial', 'incorrect'): raise Invalid('复习结果无效')\n                if type(days) is not int or not 1 <= days <= 32: raise Invalid('复习间隔须为 1 至 32 天')\n                dynamic_answer(snapshot, qid, task_id_value)\n                if any(t.get('review_question_id') == qid for t in tasks): raise Invalid('复习回答已使用')\n                next_task = {'task_id':str(uuid.uuid4()), 'concept':task['concept'], 'source_question_id':qid,\n                             'reason':'上次动态复习后的跟进；不代表正式掌握', 'interval_days':days,\n                             'scheduled_at':now.isoformat(), 'due_at':(now + dt.timedelta(days=days)).isoformat(),\n                             'status':'pending', 'previous_task_id':task_id_value}\n                task.update({'status':'completed', 'review_question_id':qid, 'result':result,\n                             'completed_at':now.isoformat(), 'next_task_id':next_task['task_id']})\n                tasks.append(next_task)\n            write(path, store)\n        if action == 'complete-review':\n            records=evidence.load_evidence(folder)\n            matching=[r for r in records if r['session_id'] == session]\n            if len(matching) != 1: raise Invalid('须引用唯一已采集正式证据')\n            record=matching[0]\n            if not evidence.current_card(record['concept'], record['card']):\n                raise Invalid('历史题卡证据不能完成复习')\n            events=store.setdefault('review_events',[])\n            completed = {event_task_id(e, store['history']) for e in events}\n            pending=[q for q in item['review_queue'] if q['concept']==record['concept'] and q['evidence_session'] != session and task_id(q) not in completed and parse_date(record['captured_at']) > parse_date(q['evidence_at'])]\n            if len(pending) != 1 or any(e['session_id'] == session for e in events):\n                raise Invalid('没有可由此证据完成的复习')\n            events.append({'task_id':task_id(pending[0]), 'plan_version':item['version'], 'concept':record['concept'], 'session_id':session,'evidence_at':record['captured_at']})\n            write(path,store)\n        stale=any(item['inputs'][k] != ctx[k] for k in item['inputs'])\n        now=dt.datetime.now(dt.timezone.utc)\n        completed = {event_task_id(e, store['history']) for e in store.get('review_events',[])}\n        reviews=[{**q,'task_id':task_id(q),'due':parse_date(q['due_at']) <= now, 'status':'completed' if task_id(q) in completed else 'pending'} for q in item['review_queue']]\n        dynamic = [{**t, 'due': t['status'] == 'pending' and parse_date(t['due_at']) <= now} for t in store.get('dynamic_reviews', [])]\n        return {'status':'stale' if stale else 'current','version':item['version'],'plan_sha256':item['plan_sha256'], 'inputs':item['inputs'],'review_queue':reviews, 'dynamic_reviews':dynamic, 'notice':'复习安排非掌握判定或教学授权；须重新检查实时门禁。'}\n\ndef main():\n    p=argparse.ArgumentParser(description=__doc__);p.add_argument('action',choices=['publish','status','complete-review','schedule-dynamic','complete-dynamic']);p.add_argument('--learner',required=True);p.add_argument('--plan');p.add_argument('--session');a=p.parse_args()\n    try:\n        if a.action=='publish' and not a.plan: raise Invalid('publish 需要 --plan')\n        if a.action=='complete-review' and not a.session: raise Invalid('complete-review 需要 --session')\n        payload=json.load(sys.stdin) if a.action in ('schedule-dynamic','complete-dynamic') else None\n        print(json.dumps(operate(a.action,a.learner,a.plan,a.session,payload),ensure_ascii=False,indent=2))\n    except (Invalid, planner.Invalid, evidence.EvidenceError, evidence.coach.Stop, evidence.roadmap.Invalid, OSError, ValueError, KeyError, TypeError) as exc:\n        print('停止：'+str(exc),file=sys.stderr); return 1\n    return 0\nif __name__=='__main__': sys.exit(main())\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
