{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n 'add_argument|def main|def status' pilot-c01-c02/scripts/coach.py; sed -n '240,300p' experiments/sigma-integration/upstream/SKILL.md; cat wiki/index.md wiki/concepts/observation-vs-inference.md pilot-c01-c02/wiki/concepts/C01.md pilot-c01-c02/wiki/sources/project-research.md\"","aggregated_output":"157:def status(ev):\n313:def main():\n316:    p=sub.add_parser('hash'); p.add_argument('question')\n318:        p=sub.add_parser(action); p.add_argument('--learner',required=True,help='不含真实姓名的化名')\n319:        if action=='start': p.add_argument('--mode',required=True,choices=list(MODES))\n321:            p.add_argument('--response',required=True); p.add_argument('--correctness',required=True,choices=['correct','partial','incorrect','unknown']); p.add_argument('--explanation',required=True,choices=['valid','invalid','unclear','none'])\n322:        if action=='explain': p.add_argument('--consent',action='store_true')\n323:        if action in ('pause','end'): p.add_argument('--text',default='')\n324:        if action=='feedback': p.add_argument('--text',required=True)\n   - Wiki root: {wiki-root}\n   - Survey timestamp: {timestamp}\n   - Curriculum source: wiki/overview.md + wiki/index.md\n   - Total teaching concepts: {N} (Teaching Concept only)\n   - Total reference pages: {M} (Standard / meta concepts — reference only)\n   - Source pages: {S}\n\n   ## Concept Map\n   | # | Concept | Wiki Pages | Prerequisites | Status | Score | Last Reviewed | Review Interval |\n   |---|---------|------------|---------------|--------|-------|---------------|-----------------|\n   | 1 | AgentLoop | concepts/AgentLoop.md, sources/learn.shareai.run-zh-s01.md | - | not-started | - | - | - |\n   | 2 | ToolRouting | concepts/ToolRouting.md, sources/learn.shareai.run-zh-s02.md | 1 | not-started | - | - | - |\n   | 3 | PlanningState | concepts/PlanningState.md, sources/learn.shareai.run-zh-s03.md | 1 | not-started | - | - | - |\n   | 4 | Subagent | concepts/Subagent.md, sources/learn.shareai.run-zh-s04.md | 1 | not-started | - | - | - |\n   | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... |\n\n   ## Reference Index\n   Standard / meta concepts (reference only — not teaching units):\n   - [[ArchitectureOverview]] — concepts/ArchitectureOverview.md\n   - [[QueryControlPlane]] — concepts/QueryControlPlane.md\n   - [[Glossary]] — concepts/Glossary.md\n   - (etc.)\n\n   ## Misconceptions\n   | # | Concept | Misconception | Root Cause | Status | Counter-Example Used |\n   |---|---------|---------------|------------|--------|---------------------|\n\n   ## Session Log\n   - [timestamp] Wiki surveyed: {wiki-root}, {N} candidate pages found\n   - [timestamp] Diagnosed level: intermediate\n   - [timestamp] Roadmap built: {N} concepts in narrative order (entire wiki curriculum)\n   - [timestamp] Concept 1: started tutoring (wiki pages read: concepts/AgentLoop.md, sources/learn.shareai.run-zh-s01.md)\n   ```\n\n   **Wiki Pages column rules** (NON-NEGOTIABLE):\n   - Always relative to wiki root, e.g. `concepts/AgentLoop.md`, not the absolute filesystem path.\n   - Comma-separated list, in read order (most foundational first).\n   - One concept may cite multiple pages (a teaching concept + its source chapter is the most common pair).\n   - If the only page is a source chapter (no concept page exists yet), that is fine — still list it.\n   - If you cannot find ANY wiki page for a concept, that concept does not belong on this roadmap. Drop it or merge it into a neighbor.\n\n5. **Generate visual roadmap** -> `roadmap.html`\n   - See [references/html-templates.md](references/html-templates.md) for the roadmap template\n   - Show **only the Teaching Concepts** as nodes with dependency arrows — Standard / meta concepts go in a separate \"Reference Index\" section, not the roadmap timeline\n   - Color-code by status: gray (not started), blue (in progress), green (mastered)\n   - Each node should display its `Wiki Pages` list as a small caption beneath the concept name (truncate after the first 2 paths if there are many; use a tooltip for the rest)\n   - Open in browser on first generation: `open roadmap.html`\n\n6. **Generate concept map** -> `concept-map/` using Excalidraw\n   - See [references/excalidraw.md](references/excalidraw.md) for element format, template, and color palette\n   - Show topic hierarchy, relationships between concepts\n   - Mirror the wiki's `[[WikiLinks]]` structure where possible\n   - Update as learner progresses\n\n### Step 3: Tutor Loop (Core)\n\nThis is the main teaching cycle. Repeat for each concept until mastery.\n\n**For each concept**:\n\n#### 3.0. Wiki Read Gate (NEW — required, blocking, runs ONCE at concept entry)\n# Wiki Index — 思维训练知识点\n\n> 本目录是课程知识维护源；试点 Wiki 为 coach 兼容快照，变更须人工核对，见 `../docs/roadmap-design.md`。Roadmap 从本索引及概念页生成，12周为参考规划。\n\n> 采用 Wiki Ingest 的「一知识实体一页」及 `[[concepts/slug]]`链接模式。课程原创材料不从受限教材批量导入。\n\n| 编号 | 概念 | 主要周次 | 先修编号 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| C01 | [[concepts/observation-vs-inference]] 观察事实与推测 | W01 | 无 |\n| C02 | [[concepts/attribute-comparison]] 多属性比较 | W01—W02 | C01 |\n| C03 | [[concepts/classification-counterexample]] 分类与反例 | W02 | C02 |\n| C04 | [[concepts/pattern-rule]] 规律识别与检验 | W03 | C02 |\n| C05 | [[concepts/systematic-enumeration]] 系统枚举 | W03 | C03, C04 |\n| C06 | [[concepts/conditional-reasoning]] 条件推理及逆推陷阱 | W04 | C01, C05 |\n| C07 | [[concepts/evidence-and-alternatives]] 证据可靠性与替代解释 | W05 | C01, C06 |\n| C08 | [[concepts/structured-argument]] 结构化论证与倾听 | W06 | C07 |\n| C09 | [[concepts/constraint-decomposition]] 复杂问题与约束分解 | W07 | C05, C06 |\n| C10 | [[concepts/perspectives-tradeoffs]] 多视角与方案权衡 | W08 | C08, C09 |\n| C11 | [[concepts/divergent-ideas]] 创造性发散 | W09（全程可穿插） | C02, C09 |\n| C12 | [[concepts/prototype-testing]] 原型测试与迭代 | W09—W11 | C09, C11 |\n| C13 | [[concepts/strategy-transfer]] 跨情境策略选择 | W10—W12 | C05, C07, C09 |\n| C14 | [[concepts/plan-monitor-reflect]] 计划、监控与反思 | W01—W12（W11—12重点） | C01, C09 |\n\n## 交叉关系\n- 观察与事实辨析 → 分类/论证/证据；不是所有箭头都表示必须先学完。\n- C14元认知从第一周起贯穿，W11—W12集中评估。\n- 创造性发散C11可提前穿插；W09只增加完整的方案—测试环节。\n\n## 参考\n- `../references/sources.md`、`../references/pedagogy.md`\n# C01 观察事实与推测\n\n- **知识点编号**：C01\n- **主要周次**：W01\n- **训练能力**：观察分析；批判性思考\n- **先修**：无\n- **概念定义（项目原创表述）**：观察事实是可以直接从材料中核查的描述；推测是对事实可能原因/含义的解释。\n\n<!-- roadmap-metadata\n{\n  \"abilities\": [\n    \"观察分析\",\n    \"批判性思考\"\n  ],\n  \"hard_prerequisites\": [],\n  \"interleavable\": []\n}\n-->\n\n## 教学动作\n列举三条可见线索→标注“事实/猜测”→说出缺少的证据。\n\n## 自编例子\n桌面有一本合着的书，并不能证明有人刚读完。\n\n## 常见错误\n把人物意图、过去事件和未来预测写成已发生的事实。\n\n## 掌握与迁移\n- **掌握判据**：面对两个新场景能各说出3条事实+1条推测，并提出一条核实方法。\n- **新情境**：看教室照片、家中鞋柜、实验记录，辨别观察和解释。\n\n## 三阶启发式引导\n1. 请先说你已经知道什么，不急着选答案。\n2. 哪条线索或哪一个限制能帮助你检查？\n3. 试着画一个表、示范一个局部步骤，再由你完成余下部分。\n\n## 对应题目\n- `ST-C01-01`\n- `ST-C01-02`\n\n## 来源与知识关系\n- **来源索引**：R04, R06（详见 `../../references/sources.md`）\n- **相关先修**：无\n- **版权**：本页表述和例子为本项目独立编写；不含原教材文本。\n---\ntitle: C01 观察事实与推测\ntype: concept\ntags: [curriculum, observation, beginner]\nsources: [project-research]\nlast_updated: 2026-11-04\n---\n# C01 观察事实与推测\n\n## Core Thesis\n可直接核查的描述和对原因、经历、意图的猜测不同。\n\n## Problem Definition\n先说题目明确呈现的信息，再区分未直接给出的解释。\n\n## Terminology\n事实：可直接核查的描述；推测：可能的解释，需额外证据。\n\n## Mental Model\n看到/题设 → 事实；由线索猜原因 → 推测；再想如何核实。\n\n## Minimal Implementation\n说出事实、标出猜测、描述如何核实；不要求揣测人物心理。\n\n## System Position\n- Inherits from: 无。\n- Prepares for: [[concepts/C02]]。\n- Sources: [[sources/project-research]]。\n\n## Common Errors (Behavioral)\n把物品状态误当成已知发生过程。\n\n## Diagnostic Questions (Step 1)\n使用已发布的诊断题卡；不凭诊断结果直接标记掌握。\n\n## Question Bank (Step 3b — Socratic)\n仅使用经发布门禁批准的 C01 题卡。\n\n## Hint Escalation Ladder (Step 3c)\n先独立尝试；H1、H2、H3 均不揭示完整答案；另设平行示范。\n\n## Misconceptions (Step 3d — Cognitive)\n可能把推测当成观察；仅在有证据时记录，避免给孩子贴标签。\n\n## Mastery Check (Step 3g)\n两种陌生场景各有三条事实与一条推测并有核实办法；使用本项目的跨机会和低提示门槛，不使用上游 80% 门槛。\n\n## Practice Tasks (Step 3h)\n审查过的不同场景练习。\n---\ntitle: 项目原创研究材料\ntype: source\nsources: []\n---\n# 项目原创研究材料\n\n- C01 原概念：`../../../wiki/concepts/observation-vs-inference.md`，来源索引 R04、R06。\n- C02 原概念：`../../../wiki/concepts/attribute-comparison.md`，来源索引 R01、R04。\n- 样题原始参考：`../../../question-bank/original-examples.md`，原题声明为项目原创。\n- 来源索引：`../../../references/sources.md`；研究材料用于追溯思路，不将外部教材正文纳入题库。\n- 教法：`../../../references/pedagogy.md`。\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
